<title>PHILIPPINES: Premiere Q1 net loss down at 1.94 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Premiere Q1 net loss down at 1.94 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Income			    6.58 vs 0.49</p>
<p>    Cost and Expenses	    11.72 vs 3.23</p>
<p>    Net loss			  1.94 vs 2.05 loss</p>
<p>Note: Full name Premiere Entertainment Productions Inc. The company said interest and non-operating income reached 3.19 million pesos against 688,594 pesos in the same period last year. -- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
